# Audi A4 B9 four-door saloon, 2016-2023.
#
# The B9: 4,726 mm long, 1,842 mm wide, 1,427 mm high, 2,820 mm wheelbase; up to
# 120 kg lighter than the B8. 1.4-3.0 petrol and 2.0/3.0 TDI; facelift in 2019.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A4
#
# Colours: Mythos Black, Floret Silver, Navarra Blue and Manhattan Grey are period
# Audi finishes.
#
# Weight: 260 in total (black 80, silver 80, blue 55, grey 45), the A4 remaining a
# strong fleet and company-car seller.
#
# Speed 240 km/h; comfort 135/533 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2016-2023 with a road tail to about 2033.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a4-b9.blend. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a4-b9/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

